- Qualified Business Income (QBI) 20% deduction: depending on your net Schedule C profit you may be eligible. With a small net profit, QBI might be small but it’s worth checking on your completed numbers.
- Keep receipts and documentation: charitable receipts, loan interest statements (1098‑E), business receipts for the $650 and home office proof, 1099s, and rent documentation.

